    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> system for embedding function calls in text.</para><para>This namespace has functions for marking up text with function calls. <ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> function call looks like @<emphasis>foo</emphasis>{<emphasis>arg1</emphasis>}{<emphasis>arg2</emphasis>}... where <emphasis>foo</emphasis> is the name of the function and its arguments are each enclosed in curly braces. <ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> function declaration for &quot;foo&quot; must be inserted into the grammar before &quot;@@foo&quot; can be recognized. </para>    </detaileddescription>
